[{"answer":"Hello, is this John Murphy?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-1-2023-06-22-23-15-15/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Hi, yes it is.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-1-2023-06-22-23-15-15/2.mp3"},{"answer":"Hi John, this is Ed Heisenburg from the Wild Dunes Spa and Resort","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-1-2023-06-22-23-15-15/3.mp3"},{"answer":"calling about your application for our lifeguard position.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-1-2023-06-22-23-15-15/4.mp3"},{"answer":"Do you have a few minutes to talk?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-1-2023-06-22-23-15-15/5.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, absolutely.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-1-2023-06-22-23-15-15/6.mp3"},{"answer":"Great. Could you give me your address?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-1-2023-06-22-23-15-15/7.mp3"},{"answer":"Sure.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-1-2023-06-22-23-15-15/8.mp3"},{"answer":"My address is 45 Elsinore Court.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-1-2023-06-22-23-15-15/9.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm sorry, was that Eleanor? Could you spell that for me?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-1-2023-06-22-23-15-15/10.mp3"},{"answer":"Sure - it's Elsinore.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-1-2023-06-22-23-15-15/11.mp3"},{"answer":"E-L-S-I-N-O-R-E.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-1-2023-06-22-23-15-15/12.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay, thanks.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-1-2023-06-22-23-15-15/13.mp3"},{"answer":"And is this the number we should reach you at in the future?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-1-2023-06-22-23-15-15/14.mp3"},{"answer":"099885767?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-1-2023-06-22-23-15-15/15.mp3"},{"answer":"No, that's my home phone,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-1-2023-06-22-23-15-15/16.mp3"},{"answer":"but let me give you my mobile number instead:","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-1-2023-06-22-23-15-15/17.mp3"},{"answer":"077896245.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-1-2023-06-22-23-15-15/18.mp3"},{"answer":"Call me on that one.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-1-2023-06-22-23-15-15/19.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay - I'll make a note of that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-1-2023-06-22-23-15-15/20.mp3"},{"answer":"Could you tell me your availability?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-1-2023-06-22-23-15-15/21.mp3"},{"answer":"Sure. I am usually available during afternoons or weekends.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-1-2023-06-22-23-15-15/22.mp3"},{"answer":"I'd prefer not to be scheduled on weeknights because I work part-time as a waiter.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-1-2023-06-22-23-15-15/23.mp3"},{"answer":"That shouldn't be a problem,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-1-2023-06-22-23-15-15/24.mp3"},{"answer":"since we don't stay open very late anyway.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-1-2023-06-22-23-15-15/25.mp3"},{"answer":"Do you have any other employment experience?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-1-2023-06-22-23-15-15/26.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, I have worked at a few other places.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-1-2023-06-22-23-15-15/27.mp3"},{"answer":"I was the baseball coach at Ridgemont High School last season.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-1-2023-06-22-23-15-15/28.mp3"},{"answer":"I see.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-1-2023-06-22-23-15-15/29.mp3"},{"answer":"And do you have any other experience that you would like us to note on your application?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-1-2023-06-22-23-15-15/30.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-1-2023-06-22-23-15-15/31.mp3"},{"answer":"Last year I worked at the beach as a rescue diver.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-1-2023-06-22-23-15-15/32.mp3"},{"answer":"Rescue diver?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-1-2023-06-22-23-15-15/33.mp3"},{"answer":"That sounds intense!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-1-2023-06-22-23-15-15/34.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, it's really just like being a lifeguard, except in the ocean instead of a pool.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-1-2023-06-22-23-15-15/35.mp3"},{"answer":"So kind of like being a lifeguard at the world's largest pool.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-1-2023-06-22-23-15-15/36.mp3"},{"answer":"Haha. I see.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-1-2023-06-22-23-15-15/37.mp3"},{"answer":"So could you tell me about the relevant skills you have?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-1-2023-06-22-23-15-15/38.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm guessing a lot, given your experience.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-1-2023-06-22-23-15-15/39.mp3"},{"answer":"I am CPR certified and have 2 years of diving experience.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-1-2023-06-22-23-15-15/40.mp3"},{"answer":"Great! It sounds like you are well qualified for this position.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-1-2023-06-22-23-15-15/41.mp3"},{"answer":"When does your CPR certification expire?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-1-2023-06-22-23-15-15/42.mp3"},{"answer":"Hm. I think in November, but let me quickly check my CPR card...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-1-2023-06-22-23-15-15/43.mp3"},{"answer":"actually, it expires in October.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-1-2023-06-22-23-15-15/44.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay, so regardless you have it through the end of the summer.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-1-2023-06-22-23-15-15/45.mp3"},{"answer":"When is your ideal time to work?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-1-2023-06-22-23-15-15/46.mp3"},{"answer":"Since I work in the restaurant on weeknights,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-1-2023-06-22-23-15-15/47.mp3"},{"answer":"I like weekends best - specifically Saturday mornings.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-1-2023-06-22-23-15-15/48.mp3"},{"answer":"I see.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-1-2023-06-22-23-15-15/49.mp3"},{"answer":"We do already have a lot of staff available on Saturdays,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-1-2023-06-22-23-15-15/50.mp3"},{"answer":"but I do need an early morning shift lifeguard.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-1-2023-06-22-23-15-15/51.mp3"},{"answer":"How early could you work Saturday morning?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-1-2023-06-22-23-15-15/52.mp3"},{"answer":"I can get there by 6 o'clock if need be.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-1-2023-06-22-23-15-15/53.mp3"},{"answer":"You'll be happy to know we open a little later than that,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-1-2023-06-22-23-15-15/54.mp3"},{"answer":"but I'll put you down for Saturday mornings here.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-1-2023-06-22-23-15-15/55.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh awesome! I can't wait to get started.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-1-2023-06-22-23-15-15/56.mp3"},{"answer":"How about you come in next Saturday, the 12th?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-1-2023-06-22-23-15-15/57.mp3"},{"answer":"That sounds good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-1-2023-06-22-23-15-15/58.mp3"},{"answer":"Great.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-1-2023-06-22-23-15-15/59.mp3"},{"answer":"We can figure out other shifts for you to work when you come in then.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-1-2023-06-22-23-15-15/60.mp3"},{"answer":"One last thing - just out of curiosity, where did you hear about us?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-1-2023-06-22-23-15-15/61.mp3"},{"answer":"I heard your ad on the radio while I was driving this morning.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-1-2023-06-22-23-15-15/62.mp3"},{"answer":"You know, I think you're the first person who has responded to our radio ads.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-1-2023-06-22-23-15-15/63.mp3"},{"answer":"It's almost always people who have seen us in the newspaper.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-1-2023-06-22-23-15-15/64.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, I don't have time to read through the newspaper every morning.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-1-2023-06-22-23-15-15/65.mp3"},{"answer":"I've plenty of time in the car to listen to radio ads.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-1-2023-06-22-23-15-15/66.mp3"},{"answer":"That makes sense.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-1-2023-06-22-23-15-15/67.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, thanks for your time, and we'll look forward to seeing you on the 12th.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-1-2023-06-22-23-15-15/68.mp3"}]
